<script type="application/ld+json">
  {"@context":"http:\/\/schema.org\/","@id":"\/products\/wagvive-ear-teeth-cleaning-wipes#product","@type":"ProductGroup","brand":{"@type":"Brand","name":"Wagvive"},"category":"Grooming","description":"A wipe is the version of dental and ear care that actually happens.Two separate tubs of finger wipes, one for teeth and one for ears. You pull a wipe over a finger, clean, and throw it away. No paste to spit out, no bottle of solution, no brushing standoff. For most dogs it is the difference between a routine you keep and one you abandon in week two.Which one do you need?These are two different products, so choose the tub that matches the job. They are not interchangeable: the ear wipe is not made for the mouth, and the dental wipe is not made for the ear canal.\n\nChoose\nWhat it does\nHow often\n\n\n\nDental wipes (50)\nA textured wipe that scrubs along the gum line to lift plaque and freshen breath before it hardens into tartar.\nA few times a week. Little and often beats a perfect daily plan you give up on.\n\n\nEar wipes (50)\nA softer, smoother wipe for the outer ear and the folds you can see, clearing wax and grime that would otherwise build up.\nAbout once a week. Floppy eared breeds and swimmers usually need it more often.\n\n\n\n50 wipes per tub\nFits over a finger, so you can feel what you are doing\nSingle use, so nothing is carried between sessions or between ears\nNo rinsing, no water, nothing to wipe off afterwards\nHow to use them. Slide one wipe over your index finger. For teeth, lift the lip and work along the outer surfaces where plaque collects, back to front. For ears, lift the ear flap and clean only the part you can see. Never push into the ear canal.Wipes clean what is already there. If you see persistent redness, discharge, swelling or a strong odour, that is a vet visit rather than a wipe.Arrives in 5 to 12 business days.","hasVariant":[{"@id":"\/products\/wagvive-ear-teeth-cleaning-wipes?variant=53158154141985#variant","@type":"Product","image":"https:\/\/wagvive.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/wipes-tub.png?v=1785630578\u0026width=1920","name":"Wagvive Dental \u0026 Ear Wipes - Dental wipes (50)","offers":{"@id":"\/products\/wagvive-ear-teeth-cleaning-wipes?variant=53158154141985#offer","@type":"Offer","availability":"http:\/\/schema.org\/InStock","price":"22.00","priceCurrency":"USD","url":"https:\/\/wagvive.com\/products\/wagvive-ear-teeth-cleaning-wipes?variant=53158154141985"},"sku":"CJYD216979603CX"},{"@id":"\/products\/wagvive-ear-teeth-cleaning-wipes?variant=53158154174753#variant","@type":"Product","image":"https:\/\/wagvive.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/wipes-ear-tub.png?v=1785630581\u0026width=1920","name":"Wagvive Dental \u0026 Ear Wipes - Ear wipes (50)","offers":{"@id":"\/products\/wagvive-ear-teeth-cleaning-wipes?variant=53158154174753#offer","@type":"Offer","availability":"http:\/\/schema.org\/InStock","price":"22.00","priceCurrency":"USD","url":"https:\/\/wagvive.com\/products\/wagvive-ear-teeth-cleaning-wipes?variant=53158154174753"},"sku":"CJYD216979602BY"}],"name":"Wagvive Dental \u0026 Ear Wipes","productGroupID":"10456337154337","url":"https:\/\/wagvive.com\/products\/wagvive-ear-teeth-cleaning-wipes"}
